{
  "id": "Milne.finite-quotient",
  "status": "pending",
  "summary": "Pending source node prop:milne-finite-quotient. The exact orbit-in-affine hypothesis yields stable affine neighborhoods; affine invariant quotient charts and characteristic-free localization now identify invariant basic opens and the restricted affine quotient map as an Arrow. Next promote principal-open compatibility to quotient-side opens for pairwise stable-chart intersections, prove canonical overlap and triple transitions with their cocycle, and construct Scheme.GlueData; the sheaf quotient, arbitrary-target universal property, and free-action etaleness remain separate.",
